My Delhaize app is your go-to for quick and easy shopping. Both online and in your favorite Delhaize store!
Download the Delhaize app and discover all its advantages:
Every Thursday new promotions and exclusive online offers;
Your digital SuperPlus card always at hand;
Order your groceries 24/24h and 7/7 days, pick them up or have them delivered the very next day;
Enjoy extra benefits with your e-Deals or by exchanging your points for products or services;
Discount on a large range of fresh products with Nutri-Score A or B thanks to Nutri-Boost.
Easily consult the digital promotions folder and benefit from all the promotions in the folder, as well as web only benefits that are only available online and on the My Delhaize app.
Order your products, pay safely and have them delivered at your home or at your shop.  Delivery possible the day after ordering, from 7 am to 9 pm, depending on your region.
Are you in the shop? Scan your Superplus card at the checkout directly from your My Delhaize app, you don't need your physical card anymore. With the My Delhaize app you can also scan the barcode of a product to get all the information you need, like the Nutri-Score. Very practical!
Thanks to the My Delhaize app you also have easy access to your Superplus account: activate your e-Deals, check your Superplus credit, redeem your points for products or partner discounts or donate your points to charity.

Are you looking for the latest fashion trends?
Use our app and discover what's new in our online shop, and much more!

Salsa Jeans is a Portuguese brand that specialises in denim, focusing on creating jeans for all body types, for all styles and for every occasion, combining expertise, innovation and technology.

Discover all the benefits:

- With the Salsa Jeans app, you’ll be able to access the entire collection and buy clothes directly on your mobile phone;

- Access to discounts and other exclusive campaigns in our online shop;

- Direct access to your personal account, where you can save your favourites and create personal lists;

- Record of everything you’ve bought, electronic receipts and access to them whenever you want, all on your favourite clothes app;

- Access to our Salsa Star points system;

- Be the first to find out what’s new!

Don't miss out! Download the Salsa Jeans clothes app!
